ir UNIQUE(userOneId,userTwoId); UserBlock PK(blockerId,blockedUserId); UserRole UNIQUE(userId,roleId). Cross-service user references and refresh replacement IDs are not database foreign keys. Multiplicity describes each named role; two-role links do not mean one shared user. role: roleId to id (declared SQL FK); user: userId to id (logical) (scalar-ID association; no declared FK); token owner: userId to id (logical) (scalar-ID association; no declared FK); requester: requesterId to User.id (scalar-ID association; no declared FK); recipient: recipientId to User.id; logical scalar IDs, no cross-service FK; blocker: blockerId to User.id (scalar-ID association; no declared FK); blocked user: blockedUserId to User.id; logical scalar IDs, no cross-service FK; successor: replacedByTokenId: optional logical successor (scalar-ID association; no declared FK)"><root><mxCell id="0" style="fontFamily=Arial;" value="" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" style="fontFamily=Arial;" value="" /><mxCell id="E01-identity-social-e1" value="role" edge="1" parent="1" source="UserRole" target="Role" style="edgeStyle=none;noEdgeStyle=1;html=1;strokeColor=light-dark(#202020,#eeeeee);strokeWidth=1;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=12;exitPerimeter=0;entryPerimeter=0;exitX=0.8399999999999997;exitY=1.0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.0;endArrow=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontColor=light-dark(#202020,#eeeeee);labelBackgroundColor=none;labelBorderColor=none;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" sourceEvidence="[&quot;backend:apps/auth-service/prisma/schema.prisma:24-45&quot;]" relationKind="association" enforcement="declared relation"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" x="0.4758918078958869" y="18.5"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="2503.5840000000003" y="442.80751999999995" /><mxPoint x="2353.9840000000004" y="442.80751999999995" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="E01-identity-social-e1_multiplicity0" value="0..*" vertex="1" parent="E01-identity-social-e1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpa