constraints. Enforced relations and scalar-ID mappings are listed below; cross-service IDs are not foreign keys. UNIQUE(seriesId,episodeNumber) orders episodes. ViewSession PK is (userId,reelId,playbackSessionId). ViewEvent UNIQUE(userId,reelId,playbackSessionId,sequence). Outbox aggregate and playback-session correlation links have no declared FK. series: seriesId; nullable; onDelete SetNull (declared SQL FK); reel: reelId; Cascade delete (declared SQL FK); reel: reelId; Cascade delete (declared SQL FK); reel: reelId; Cascade delete (declared SQL FK); reel: reelId; Cascade delete (declared SQL FK); aggregate: aggregateId when aggregateType=REEL (logical) (scalar-ID association; no declared FK); playback session: userId + reelId + playbackSessionId correlation (scalar-ID association; no declared FK) Operational upload/media-attempt lease rows are Content-owned; their publishIntentId/mediaKey and reelId/attemptId links are logical correlations, not declared Prisma FKs."><root><mxCell id="0" style="fontFamily=Arial;" value="" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" style="fontFamily=Arial;" value="" /><mxCell id="E02-content-e1" value="series" edge="1" parent="1" source="Reel" target="ReelSeries" style="edgeStyle=none;noEdgeStyle=1;html=1;strokeColor=light-dark(#202020,#eeeeee);strokeWidth=1;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=12;exitPerimeter=0;entryPerimeter=0;exitX=0.43199999999999983;exitY=0.9999999999999994;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.0;endArrow=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontColor=light-dark(#202020,#eeeeee);labelBackgroundColor=none;labelBorderColor=none;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" sourceEvidence="[&quot;backend:apps/content-service/prisma/schema.prisma:139-256&quot;]" relationKind="association" enforcement="declared relation"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" x="0.39802323941675866" y="26.0"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1218.0639999999999" y="1198.390944" /><mxPoint x="1247.984" y="1198.390944" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="E02-c